{
  "id": "155",
  "title": "The Girl has Grown Into A Woman",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2016-08-10",
  "synopsis": "For once Little Ming is behaving well and gives his cousin who is back from abroad a compliment. Or does he?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/201/4d2ebbc4718d4c6691c5c4d3e97baafc7208e6c6.mp3",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "女大十八变\n\n    小明的表姐从国外回来，小明一见到表姐就说：“表姐，那么多年不见，你真是女大十八变呀。”\n    一般说“女大十八变”，后面的一句都是“越变越漂亮”，所以表姐很高兴，笑着说：“小明嘴巴真甜。”\n    但是小明又说了一句：“你小时候多漂亮啊……”",
    "traditional": "女大十八變\n\n    小明的表姐從國外回來，小明一見到表姐就說：“表姐，那麼多年不見，你真是女大十八變呀。”\n    一般說“女大十八變”，後面的一句都是“越變越漂亮”，所以表姐很高興，笑著說：“小明嘴巴真甜。”\n    但是小明又說了一句：“你小時候多漂亮啊……”"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "The Girl has Grown Into A Woman"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小明的表姐从国外回来，小明一见到表姐就说：",
      "traditional": "小明的表姐從國外回來，小明一見到表姐就說：",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng de biǎo jiě cóng guó wài huí lai xiǎo míng yí jiàn dào biǎo jiě jiù shuō",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "“表姐，那么多年不见，你真是女大十八变呀。”",
      "traditional": "“表姐，那麼多年不見，你真是女大十八變呀。”",
      "pinyin": "biǎo jiě nà me duō nián bú jiàn nǐ zhēn shì nǚ dà shí bā biàn ya",
      "english": "Little Ming's female cousin came back from abroad, and as soon as Little Ming saw her he said:"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "“Cousin, we haven't met for so many years. You've really grown from a little girl into a woman.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "一般说“女大十八变”，后面的一句都是“越变越漂亮”，",
      "traditional": "一般說“女大十八變”，後面的一句都是“越變越漂亮”，",
      "pinyin": "yì bān shuō nǚ dà shí bā biàn hòu miàn de yí jù dōu shì yuè biàn yuè piào liang",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "所以表姐很高兴，笑着说：“小明嘴巴真甜。”",
      "traditional": "所以表姐很高興，笑著說：“小明嘴巴真甜。”",
      "pinyin": "suǒ yǐ biǎo jiě hěn gāo xìng xiào zhe shuō xiǎo míng zuǐ ba zhēn tián",
      "english": "Usually when you say someone's grown into a woman, you add “you've turned even more beautiful” .."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ".. so the cousin smiled happily and said: “Little Ming, you are such a sweet talker.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "但是小明又说了一句：“你小时候多漂亮啊……”",
      "traditional": "但是小明又說了一句：“你小時候多漂亮啊……”",
      "pinyin": "dàn shì xiǎo míng yòu shuō le yí jù nǐ xiǎo shí hou duō piào liang a",
      "english": ""
    }
  ],
