    "sentence_translations": [
      "The Girl has Grown Into A Woman",
      "",
      "Little Ming's female cousin came back from abroad, and as soon as Little Ming saw her he said:",
      "“Cousin, we haven't met for so many years. You've really grown from a little girl into a woman.”",
      "",
      "Usually when you say someone's grown into a woman, you add “you've turned even more beautiful” ..",
      ".. so the cousin smiled happily and said: “Little Ming, you are such a sweet talker.”",
      "",
      "But Little Ming added: “You were really pretty when you were little...”"
    ]
